			"notes": "Mod compatibility fixes and faster terrain generation:\n\n- Fix modded biome decorators running on whole chunks where the biome barely appears (issue #16): with Cherry_on installed, pink petals spawned everywhere grass generates. The modded biome decoration pass now samples the biome at the center of the population region, like vanilla 1.12.2 does\n- Fix a crash in custom dungeon chest placement when another mod's chest block state lacks the expected chest properties (from PR #17, thanks @NNYYOONNIIOO)\n- Extended-height worlds now render correctly under **Celeritas** and its shader fork **Actinium** (issue #14) — update CaveBiomesAPI to 1.1.3, it is required\n- Faster terrain generation: memoized density evaluations, one preliminary-surface pass per column, cached heightmaps during decoration. World generation output is bit-identical to 2.0.3\n- Mod icon for launchers and the in-game mod list\n\n**Requires CaveBiomesAPI 1.1.3.**"
		},
