			"notes": "Mod compatibility and biome fixes:\n\n- Modded biomes added through Forge's BiomeManager (e.g. Thaumcraft's Magical Forest) now generate in native-profile worlds: they overlay the 1.18 climate projection, drive biome tints, get their vanilla biome.decorate pass (Silverwood/Greatwood trees are back), and can be found with Nature's Compass (issue #7)\n- Lush caves and dripstone caves are real registered biomes now — F3 and biome-reading mods report them instead of Forest/Extreme Hills\n- Fix F3 showing \"Outside of world...\" below Y=0\n- Fix startup crash with Better With Mods (pumpkin recipe replacement) and harden villager trade rewrite against modded trades (issue #15)\n- Fix deepslate and infested deepslate generating sideways\n- Fix the production jar failing to launch: CauldronMixin refmap was missing the LEVEL field mapping"
		},
